            <ArticleTitle>Introduction to special section on advanced methodology: Counseling the dog to wag its methodological tail.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>601-603</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1037/cou0000253</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In this article, we introduce a special section focused on the application of advanced methodologies to specific research questions in counseling psychology. The articles include applications of natural language processing, dynamic systems, mediation analyses in single studies and meta-analysis, and synthesis of qualitative research. We provide a brief overview of each article. (PsycINFO Database Record</AbstractText>
